er Control and Removal Services in Melbourne \u2013 Keep Your Home Pest-Free\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/#website\"},\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/crawling-spiders-in-your-kitchen-or-wardrobe-heres-how-melbourne-homes-can-stay-pest-free\/#primaryimage\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/crawling-spiders-in-your-kitchen-or-wardrobe-heres-how-melbourne-homes-can-stay-pest-free\/#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-06-27-at-3.21.40-PM-1-1024x538-1.jpeg\",\"datePublished\":\"2025-06-28T06:51:16+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2025-07-16T10:04:31+00:00\",\"description\":\"Tired of spiders in your kitchen or wardrobe? Discover expert spider control and removal services in Melbourne to protect your home and family today.\",\"breadcrumb\":{\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/crawling-spiders-in-your-kitchen-or-wardrobe-heres-how-melbourne-homes-can-stay-pest-free\/#breadcrumb\"},\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"ReadAction\",\"target\":[\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/crawling-spiders-in-your-kitchen-or-wardrobe-heres-how-melbourne-homes-can-stay-pest-free\/\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/crawling-spiders-in-your-kitchen-or-wardrobe-heres-how-melbourne-homes-can-stay-pest-free\/#primaryimage\",\"url\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-06-27-at-3.21.40-PM-1-1024x538-1.jpeg\",\"contentUrl\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/06\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-06-27-at-3.21.40-PM-1-1024x538-1.jpeg\",\"width\":1024,\"height\":538,\"caption\":\"spider control melbourne\"},{\"@type\":\"BreadcrumbList\",\"@id\":\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/crawling-spiders-in-your-kitchen-or-wardrobe-heres-how-melbourn